<http://data.europa.eu/a4g/resource/b118581f-d9d5-4a4f-97b0-5c08dab3e562-01/SelectionCriterion$_PriorInformationNotice1_ProcurementProjectLot1_TenderingTerms1_UBLExtensions1_UBLExtension1_ExtensionContent1_EformsExtension1_SelectionCriteria3>
